				"text": "Option Explicit\nOption Base 1\n#Const DEBUGMODE = 1\nConst SEP = \"-\"\nType Person\n  name As String\n  age As Integer\nEnd Type\nDim t As Integer, bad As Integer\nDim i As Integer, j As Integer, k As Integer, s As String, n As Integer\nDim v(5) As Integer\nDim w(0 To 4) As Integer\nDim folk(2) As Person\n\nPrint \"VB test 2\"\n' colon separated, comments with quotes\nn = 1: n = n + 1 ' it's a comment\nChk n, 2\nChkS \"it's\" & SEP, \"it's-\"\nREM a rem line\n#If DEBUGMODE Then\n  n = 10\n#Else\n  n = 20\n#End If\nChk n, 10\n' option base 1\nFor i = 1 To 5: v(i) = i * 2: Next\nChk v(1) + v(5), 12\nFor i = 0 To 4: w(i) = i: Next\nChk w(0) + w(4), 4\n' line continuation\nn = 1 + _\n    2 + _\n    3\nChk n, 6\n' optional params\nChk Area(3), 9\nChk Area(3, 4), 12\n' byref string\ns = \"abc\"\nShout s\nChkS s, \"ABC!\"\n' nested string functions\nChkS Left$(UCase$(\"hello\"), 2), \"HE\"\nn = 0\ns = \"banana\"\nFor i = 1 To Len(s)\n  If Mid$(s, i, 1) = \"a\" Then n = n + 1\nNext\nChk n, 3\n' unary\nn = 5\nChk -n, -5\nChk Not 0, -1\nChk (n > 3) And (n < 10), -1\n' exit sub from nested loops\nChk FindPair(7), 25\n' gosub inside a sub\nChk Inner(), 111\n' public var from module 2\nShared = 41\nBumpShared\nChk Shared, 42\n' same private name in two modules\nChk Helper(), 1\nChk Mod2Helper(), 2\n' type with string\nfolk(1).name = \"Ann\"\nfolk(1).age = 30\nfolk(2).name = \"Bob\"\nfolk(2).age = folk(1).age + 5\nChkS folk(1).name & folk(2).name, \"AnnBob\"\nChk folk(2).age, 35\n' do loop forms\nn = 0\nDo\n  n = n + 1\nLoop While n < 5\nChk n, 5\nn = 0\nDo Until n >= 3\n  n = n + 1\nLoop\nChk n, 3\n' step down\nk = 0\nFor i = 10 To 1 Step -1: k = k + i: Next\nChk k, 55\n' single line if with several statements and else\nn = 0: k = 0\nIf n = 0 Then n = 1: k = 2 Else n = 9: k = 9\nChk n * 10 + k, 12\n' call without parens and with Call\nCall Nothing\nNothing\nChk GetSeven(), 7\nChk GetSeven + 1, 8\n' select with strings and Is\nChkS Sz(5), \"small\"\nChkS Sz(50), \"mid\"\nChkS Sz(500), \"big\"\nPrint\nPrint t; \" tests, \"; bad; \" failed\"\nPrint \"Press a key\";\nDo : Frame : Loop Until Inkey <> 0\nPrint\nEnd\n\nSub Chk(ByVal got As Integer, ByVal want As Integer)\n  t = t + 1\n  Print t; \":\";\n  If got = want Then Print \"ok \"; Else Print \"FAIL(\"; got; \") \"; : bad = bad + 1\nEnd Sub\n\nSub ChkS(ByVal got As String, ByVal want As String)\n  t = t + 1\n  Print t; \":\";\n  If got = want Then Print \"ok \"; Else Print \"FAIL[\"; got; \"] \"; : bad = bad + 1\nEnd Sub\n\nFunction Area(ByVal a As Integer, Optional ByVal b As Integer = -1) As Integer\n  If b = -1 Then b = a\n  Area = a * b\nEnd Function\n\nSub Shout(txt As String)\n  txt = UCase$(txt) & \"!\"\nEnd Sub\n\nFunction FindPair(ByVal target As Integer) As Integer\n  Dim x As Integer, y As Integer\n  For x = 1 To 5\n    For y = 1 To 5\n      If x + y = target Then\n        FindPair = x * 10 + y\n        Exit Function\n      End If\n    Next\n  Next\n  FindPair = -1\nEnd Function\n\nFunction Inner() As Integer\n  Dim r As Integer\n  GoSub addone\n  GoSub addten\n  r = r + 100\n  Inner = r\n  Exit Function\naddone:\n  r = r + 1\n  Return\naddten:\n  r = r + 10\n  Return\nEnd Function\n\nPrivate Function Helper() As Integer\n  Helper = 1\nEnd Function\n\nSub Nothing()\nEnd Sub\n\nFunction GetSeven() As Integer\n  GetSeven = 7\nEnd Function\n\nFunction Sz(ByVal n As Integer) As String\n  Select Case n\n    Case Is < 10\n      Sz = \"small\"\n    Case 10 To 99\n      Sz = \"mid\"\n    Case Else\n      Sz = \"big\"\n  End Select\nEnd Function\n"
